import{_ as t,o as n,c as o,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 838 | Transcended Ones and Education | The Transcended One's Knowledge Popularization to Myriad Ranks","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 838 | Transcended Ones and Education | The Transcended One's Knowledge Popularization to Myriad Ranks","no":838,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Knowledge Popularization","Myriad Ranks","Selfless Dao","Knowledge Equality"],"related":["69-Technical Openness and Sharing Mechanism","18-Cultivation-Resource Openness Mechanism","781-The Transcended One's Myriad-Rank Education Duty","50-Myriad-Rank Lineage Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0838_模块4-超脱者与教育-万族知识普及.md","filePath":"en/0838_模块4-超脱者与教育-万族知识普及.md"}`),a={name:"en/0838_模块4-超脱者与教育-万族知识普及.md"};function s(r,e,l,d,u,h){return n(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-838-transcended-ones-and-education-the-transcended-one-s-knowledge-popularization-to-myriad-ranks" tabindex="-1">Entry 838 | Transcended Ones and Education | The Transcended One&#39;s Knowledge Popularization to Myriad Ranks <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-838-transcended-ones-and-education-the-transcended-one-s-knowledge-popularization-to-myriad-ranks" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 838 | Transcended Ones and Education | The Transcended One&#39;s Knowledge Popularization to Myriad Ranks&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 18, 50, 69, 781</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-if-knowledge-does-not-go-to-the-countryside-myriad-ranks-are-forever-at-the-foot-of-the-mountain" tabindex="-1">Introduction: if knowledge does not go to the countryside, Myriad Ranks are forever at the foot of the mountain <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-if-knowledge-does-not-go-to-the-countryside-myriad-ranks-are-forever-at-the-foot-of-the-mountain" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: if knowledge does not go to the countryside, Myriad Ranks are forever at the foot of the mountain&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world&#39;s knowledge has &quot;walls.&quot; Top manuals hidden in sect forbidden grounds; core insights locked in strong ones&#39; secret chambers; even &quot;how to cultivate,&quot; the most basic matter, had to be bought by kowtowing, risking life, acting as a grandson for half a sentence. Myriad Ranks&#39; bottom beings do not not want to evolve; they simply do not know &quot;the road exists.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou tears down this wall — <strong>the transcended one must not only write out what he has comprehended, but actively deliver it to every Myriad-Rank being&#39;s doorstep.</strong> This entry specifically discusses the &quot;knowledge popularization&quot; segment: how the transcended one translates hyper-multiverse-grade knowledge into something Myriad Ranks may reach and use.</p><p>Six top-level axioms centrally embody <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong>: all beings own equal evolutionary qualification; knowledge is this qualification&#39;s precondition; <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong> requires the Great Dao full-level open, no private hoarding no monopoly; <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> requires knowledge popularization serve Myriad Ranks&#39; universal uplift; <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong> requires popularization process not mislead, not incite; <strong>the law-first axiom</strong> requires knowledge expression self-consistent and accurate, not spreading half-baked settings.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-popularization-is-not-alms-but-civilizational-security-engineering" tabindex="-1">I. Popularization Is Not &quot;Alms,&quot; But Civilizational-Security Engineering <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-popularization-is-not-alms-but-civilizational-security-engineering" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Popularization Is Not &quot;Alms,&quot; But Civilizational-Security Engineering&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Calling knowledge popularization &quot;care for the weak&quot; is still condescending. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s positioning of knowledge popularization is harder: <strong>it is civilizational-security engineering.</strong></p><ul><li>The more widespread knowledge, the fewer the short-cut inner demon&#39;s student source — when the right road is known to all, no one walks the evil road;</li><li>The more widespread knowledge, the thicker Myriad Ranks&#39; &quot;universal-evolution chassis&quot; — the anchor network&#39;s effectiveness positively correlates with accessed beings&#39; quantity and quality (Document 08);</li><li>The more widespread knowledge, the harder class solidification — once the bottom knows the road exists and may obtain textbooks, they will not long stay in &quot;abandoned&quot; state.</li></ul><p>So popularizing knowledge is not the transcended one&#39;s good deed, but his responsibility for civilization&#39;s overall stability.</p><h2 id="ii-knowledge-popularization-s-four-tiers" tabindex="-1">II. Knowledge Popularization&#39;s Four Tiers <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-knowledge-popularization-s-four-tiers" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Knowledge Popularization&#39;s Four Tiers&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one faces Myriad Ranks&#39; five lineages, countless life forms and cognitive levels. Popularization may not be one-size-fits-all; it divides into four tiers:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Tier</th><th>Object</th><th>Form</th><th>Goal</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Enlightenment tier</td><td>Beings not yet entered the door</td><td>Diagrams, stories, sensory demonstrations</td><td>Let them know &quot;the road exists&quot;</td></tr><tr><td>Entry tier</td><td>Newly entered cultivators</td><td>Structured textbooks, basic methods, online Q&amp;A</td><td>Let them truly start walking</td></tr><tr><td>Advanced tier</td><td>Those with some realm</td><td>Systematic courses, simulated training, mentor matching</td><td>Let them walk steadily, not astray</td></tr><tr><td>Frontier tier</td><td>Research-type cultivators</td><td>Hyper-multiverse-grade manuals, law-engineering documents</td><td>Let knowledge continue pushing forward</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Four tiers share the same knowledge source (Selfless Dao public textbook library), only expression depth differs. This ensures: a bottommost plant spirit, and a topmost researcher, read the same set of Dao — only the former reads the &quot;entry version,&quot; the latter the &quot;complete version.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-translating-for-myriad-ranks-five-lineages" tabindex="-1">III. &quot;Translating&quot; for Myriad Ranks&#39; Five Lineages <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-translating-for-myriad-ranks-five-lineages" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. &quot;Translating&quot; for Myriad Ranks&#39; Five Lineages&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Popularization&#39;s greatest technical difficulty is <strong>translation.</strong> Carbon-based humans&#39; textbooks, plant spirits cannot read; energy-condensed lineage&#39;s cultivation descriptions, mechanical-constructed lineage cannot execute. The transcended one must take the lead, translating knowledge into each life form&#39;s receivable format:</p><ul><li><strong>Carbon-based matter lineage</strong>: conventional text, diagrams, hands-on demonstrations suffice;</li><li><strong>Energy-condensed lineage</strong>: textbooks need translation into &quot;frequency-rhythm&quot; consciousness-state expression;</li><li><strong>Mechanical-constructed lineage</strong>: need translation into &quot;parameter-instruction&quot; structure-state expression;</li><li><strong>Consciousness-information lineage</strong>: need direct connection to the consciousness domain, using intent rather than text to transmit;</li><li><strong>Hybrid-mutated lineage</strong>: need to develop compatible multi-lineage composite expression, customized per life form.</li></ul><p>Translation is not &quot;translating language,&quot; but &quot;translating life forms.&quot; This only the transcended one taking the lead may do fully — this is also why knowledge popularization is the transcended one&#39;s legal duty, not something ordinary teachers may independently complete.</p><h2 id="iv-popularization-and-causal-self-discipline-do-not-mislead-do-not-incite" tabindex="-1">IV. Popularization and Causal Self-Discipline: Do Not Mislead, Do Not Incite <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-popularization-and-causal-self-discipline-do-not-mislead-do-not-incite" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Popularization and Causal Self-Discipline: Do Not Mislead, Do Not Incite&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Knowledge popularization also has risks. If expression is improper or taken out of context, hyper-multiverse-grade knowledge may be misunderstood and abused. Heng Yuan Zhou therefore requires:</p><ul><li>All popularization content is consistent with formal textbooks; not &quot;simplified to distortion&quot; in transmission;</li><li>Popularization materials reviewed by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision; versions that may induce predation, incite antagonism, or mislead causality may not be published;</li><li>Popularization to Myriad Ranks only returns &quot;knowledge,&quot; does not make decisions on behalf — each being still chooses which road to walk (see Document 87 &quot;knowledge-only return principle&quot;).</li></ul><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: let sleeping Myriad-Rank potential be awakened, universally access the anchor network, thicken civilizational-evolution chassis</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: knowledge openness itself is anti-predation — once the wall falls, the &quot;knowledge private hoarding&quot; predatory path is gone</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s core knowledge relies on Gu Chensha&#39;s grace; ordinary people do not even know the road; Heng Yuan Zhou actively delivers knowledge to every Myriad-Rank being&#39;s doorstep</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: four tiers + five-lineage translation ensure 99% coverage; plant spirits, planetary consciousnesses, consciousness-information lineage may all reach it</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: all textbooks open through the Selfless Dao network-wide; tier versions share one source; frontier knowledge sets no threshold</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-knowledge-popularization-s-metrics-and-endpoint" tabindex="-1">Supplement: Knowledge Popularization&#39;s Metrics and Endpoint <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-knowledge-popularization-s-metrics-and-endpoint" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: Knowledge Popularization&#39;s Metrics and Endpoint&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Popularization is not &quot;after distributing textbooks done&quot;; it has its own metrics and endpoint. The anchor network counts each plane&#39;s, each clan&#39;s textbook reach rate, mastery rate, advancement conversion rate; these data flow into the transcended one&#39;s civilizational-weight assessment — broader coverage, higher conversion, heavier weight. Popularization&#39;s endpoint is not &quot;everyone has read,&quot; but Myriad Ranks&#39; 99% truly &quot;have a road to walk, have a will to walk.&quot; When a most remote plant-spirit clan may also free-retrieve adapted textbooks and complete system-compatibility assessment, popularization truly lands. This is also the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&#39;s &quot;hyper-multiverse&quot; meaning — it is not only the strong ones&#39; realm, but the degree to which Myriad Ranks as a whole are illuminated by knowledge.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>If knowledge does not go to the countryside, Myriad Ranks are forever at the foot of the mountain. The transcended one&#39;s knowledge popularization to Myriad Ranks is turning &quot;evolution right&quot; from a promise into something every being may truly obtain. It does not rely on alms, but on engineered four tiers and cross-lineage translation; does not rely on slogans, but on Alaya supervision preventing misleading. When every Myriad-Rank being knows the road exists, may obtain textbooks, and can understand, &quot;Myriad Ranks have a path&quot; changes from words on the wall into a road underfoot.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/69-技术开放与共享机制.html">Entry 69 · Technical Openness and Sharing Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/18-修炼资源开放机制.html">Entry 18 · Cultivation-Resource Openness Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/50-万族谱系总览.html">Entry 50 · Myriad-Rank Lineage Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/781_模块4-万族-超脱者的教育责任.html">Entry 781 · The Transcended One&#39;s Myriad-Rank Education Duty</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const p=t(a,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
